cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference these rules, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "cursor-rules: Cursor Rules and Agent Skills for AI Coding Agents"
abstract: >-
  Version-aware, security-first coding rules and Agent Skills for AI coding
  agents. One Markdown source builds Cursor project rules (.mdc), AGENTS.md,
  CLAUDE.md and Agent Skills (SKILL.md) for Cursor, Claude Code, OpenAI Codex,
  GitHub Copilot and Gemini CLI. Each stack rule checks the installed framework
  version first, applies current conventions and security controls mapped to
  OWASP Top 10:2025 and the CWE Top 25, lists dated known vulnerabilities with
  minimum safe versions, and switches to legacy guidance and a migration path
  for end-of-life versions.
